e new public proofs close this comparison through the actual two algorithms and an Archimedean witness. OGD starts at1, the source mean predictor at1/2; each OGD run uses its known positive horizon. The terminal is unbounded-tail existence, not an equal-initialization, every-stream, every-initialization, single-anytime-run, Tendsto, minimax or Chapter4 guarantee. These are derived refinements, not three numerical theorems printed in the book. The source real[0,1] labels, prediction-before-feedback order, true projection/gradient and produced global square regularity are retained. The printed O(sqrtT) and derived constant2sqrtT are distinguished.\n\nNine existing public proofs and one domain definition are revalidated with their mathematical tokens fixed; the two original canary modules are bytefixed. A new nondegenerate canary compares both actual algorithms at n4/T64/eta1/16 and proves a gap at least3/4. Eight source-review reader corrections and the five-step proof bridge are integrated into the existing shared Book route.\n\nValidation:\n\n- All three frozen scratch bodies and the public focused build passed. Twelve unchanged native theorem headers,21 unique named axiom audits (standard-three-or-none/no sorryAx), all three canary modules and12 separate native guards passed.\n- Sequential combined root9089jobs/Tests9232jobs and full harness466tests/seven existing skips passed. These are fresh gate invocations with cached jobs, not a clean rebuild of every job. Distinct required automated contract/body/final-reader actors recorded; no human/external/runtime-model attestation.\n- Actual scoped compiled graph13nodes/2113 direct type/value references includes the genuine comparison dependency edges. It is not a full or canary graph export. Clean lean-verified local site at `e8cf14406586d6e14e399137a87a73c52ace19a6`,13 shared scoped nodes/all10806oldIDsURLs preserved/3 new comparison nodes, site checks and viewed actual first viewport passed.\n- Failed guessed historical input path/import doc-marker parsing/untracked-new-source packaging/Tests-in-production-list checks are preserved. Repairs only corrected metadata/parser/Git visibility; no mathematical statement, proof or canary weakening. Unused reader proof field adapted to the renderer's actual proof_bridge with identical mathematical content.\n\nStacked on OPEN draft#163 at exact25c77a837c849eb78832673063483db5f663a73a, not main. Exact stacked contributor gate covers seven production surfaces/one manifest; main-relative diagnostics still lack9other legacy contracts. Raw whitespace diagnostics on preserved evidence remain failed; scoped production/JSON/scripts/docs passed with enumerated raw exceptions. Historical local raw receipt bindings and task-only frontier/shadow passed. A run-local .gitattributes retains exact current-run evidence bytes in Git, and a separate committed-raw audit passes; older directories were not changed or blanket recertified across platforms; global reference-index rewrite was not run outside this bounded scope.\n\nThis accepts only source Example2.14 and its derived comparison, reducing remaining legacy migrations13→11 for OnlineGuessingOGD/OnlineGuessingLower only; the three new proofs are separate mathematical growth. Chapter1 migration and Chapter2 mandatorytotal null/incomplete, Chapters1–16 Goal active. No merge, deployment, main/live update or worktree retirement.\n\nEvidence: runs/online-guessing-migration-20261006/{accepted-decision-v1.json,integrated-gates-overlay-v1.json,final-reader-receipt-v1.json,accepted-binding-audit-v1.json}; frozen source/statement contracts: docs/contracts/online-guessing-migration-v1.\n\nDelivery evidence addendum: run-local `* -text` retains current-run raw bytes in Git; a separate committed-raw audit checked395files. The post-preservation default whitespace check flagged CRLF terminal CR; the scoped rerun enables `cr-at-eol` for this command while retaining blank-at-eol/blank-at-eof/space-before-tab and enumerated raw exceptions, and passes. Its failed predecessor is retained. This changes no source, Lean, canary or reader bytes and does not recertify older directories across platforms. Final contributor gate passes for the same seven production surfaces.\n","created_at":"2026-10-05T17:28:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T17:30:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1313b22f1fb495d63bf6411f13f3b3e86249e607","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/164/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/164/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/164/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/52f628a7ae699887069c5a621d301901718ed772","head":{"label":"DakeBU:codex/research-online-guessing-migration","ref":"codex/research-online-guessing-migration","sha":"52f628a7ae699887069c5a621d301901718ed772","user":{"login":"DakeBU","id":159223240,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX2NyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159223240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dake